uth admiring the intellectual glamour of The Philadelphia Story. However, he was reportedly disappointed when Audrey, a very skinny girl in Capri pants showed up instead of the established Katharine. This meeting sparked a 40-year collaboration that defined the gamine look.\nIdentify this designer, whose name is now synonymous with the \"Little Black Dress\" worn by Audrey Hepburn in Breakfast at Tiffany's.", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-19T14:20:39Z", "username": "Chinmay Mehta", "text": "Givenchy?", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-19T14:20:49Z", "username": "Chinmay Mehta", "text": "Mctukka", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-19T14:20:54Z", "username": "Kartikey Pradhan", "text": "Correct!", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-19T14:21:05Z", "username": "Kartikey Pradhan", "text": "Hubert de Givenchy was the man", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-19T14:21:18Z", "username": "Kartikey Pradhan", "text": "And that’s all folks from the Delhi Meetup icebreaker set 😂", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-19T14:21:46Z", "username": "Chinmay Mehta", "text": "Isse icebreak hua ki bas sabka man hua tumhara sar break karne ka??", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-19T14:21:58Z", "username": "Chinmay Mehta", "text": "Hope you asked it before beer started!", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}]